@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:6010
@xsrfToken = copy-the-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-from-the-status-response
@projectId = 000000000000000000000001
@downloadId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Initialize cookies; retain both cookies and copy XSRF-TOKEN into xsrfToken.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Public connector identity and one-time development setup directory (200).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/extension

### Refresh through the connected browser (503 when disconnected, 409 when Overleaf sign-in is needed).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/projects/refresh
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

### Download a project from that list (201 with Location).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/projects/{{projectId}}/downloads
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

### List locally persisted snapshots.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/downloads

### Read a snapshot (404 for a nonexistent ID).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/downloads/{{downloadId}}

### Retrieve its ZIP.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/downloads/{{downloadId}}/archive

### Native transport requires a mutually authenticated registered bridge (401).
GET {{baseUrl}}/native

### Missing request protection is rejected (403).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/overleaf/projects/refresh

### Development OpenAPI.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
